OL,3,AStruggling households need more help
OL,4,Awith bills, energy industry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, the energy price cap for
OL,7,FOctober onwards will be announced by
OL,8,Fregulator Ofgem and is expected to hit
OL,9,Fa three-year high.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
