OL,3,ADozens of co-ordinated arson attacks
OL,4,Ahit southern Thailand
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 co-ordinated arson and
OL,7,Fincendiary attacks "aimed at creating
OL,8,Funrest" have been carried out across
OL,9,FThailand's insurgency-hit south, the
OL,10,FThai military has said.
OL,12,FAt least two people were injured, with
OL,13,Fa local government office building, a
OL,14,Fconvenience store, and a stolen vehicle
OL,15,Famong the targets set on fire.
OL,17,FThe incidents took place across the
OL,18,Fcountry's southern border provinces
OL,19,Fbetween 20:00 local time (13:00 GMT)
OL,20,Fand midnight on Saturday, the
OL,21,Fmilitary's Internal Security Operations
OL,22,FCommand said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
